 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5140+) If not between members of the same master-vassal(s) locus, added an alternative military power based tech trade contact chance modifier in `CvPlayerAI::AI_doDiplo`, so that we have a higher chance to trade with militarily weaker players to us (safer, less likely to backstab us) and a lower chance for stronger players to us (more likely to become our ennemies or to bite us back in some way). In autoplay, seemingly results in much closer game, where the runaway Ewuare is now regularly and repeatedly caught up by other rivals and vice versa when these take the lead as well, until late in the game where game ends at turn 419 vs 288 before and was close until the last few or such dozen turns. See for details [KI#80](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#80---tremendously-improved-ai-contacting-for-tech-trades-players-that-are-stronger-even-though-this-is-more-likely-to-be-detrimental).
